# The ICU data that the browser's BusyTeX keeps (see build-busytex); the
# rest of ICU's 21 MB is converters, collation, locales, and other data
# that XeTeX does not use.  One shell pattern per line.
#
# XeTeX's font manager opens converters macintosh, UTF16BE, and UTF8
cnvalias.icu
macos-0_2-10.2.cnv
# resource bundles, and the properties that line-break rules use
pool.res
res_index.res
root.res
uemoji.icu
ulayout.icu
# line breaking for \XeTeXlinebreaklocale, without the CJK, Thai, Lao,
# Khmer, and Burmese dictionaries
brkitr/*.res
brkitr/*.brk
